<title>GREECE: Greek inflation seen at 6.0pct at end-97 - Deutsche.</title>
<headline>Greek inflation seen at 6.0pct at end-97 - Deutsche.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said in its February economic and financial outlook that it expected Greek inflation to be around 6.0 percent at the end of 1997.</p>
<p>It also expected three-month drachma rates to drop about 100 basis points to 10.75 percent in the next six months.</p>
</text>
